<title>USA: HealthSouth Corp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>HealthSouth Corp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthSouth Corp said Friday its board has declared a 2-for-1 common stock split to be effected as a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>If approved by stockholders, the split would increase the number of authorized shares of common stock to 500 million from 250 million.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to seek approval for the split at a special stockholder meeting in March.</p>
</text>
